#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa11b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to retrieve all enemy scouts<C=R> lurking in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Killing even one enemy soldier will result in instant mission failure<C=R>. \n"
"  Time Limit: 16:00\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 11"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>使用富尔顿回收系统回收所有潜伏在中埃雷迪亚云雾林中的敌方侦察兵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>杀死哪怕一名敌兵都会导致任务立即失败<C=R>。\n  时间限制：16:00\n  时间惩罚：触发警报加1分钟\n  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n  目标数：11"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa11b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Target practice<C=R> at Mother Base's Shooting Range. You have unlimited ammo.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Exit the Shooting Range to end<C=R>.\n"
"Support supply markers and support strike markers are not allowed.\n"
"  # of Targets: Unlimited"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>在母基地射击场进行打靶练习<C=R>。弹药无限。\n<C=FF4040>离开射击场即结束<C=R>。\n不允许使用支援补给标记和支援打击标记。\n  目标数：无限"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa21b1e
msgid "ABOUT SBM027"
msgstr "关于SBM027"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa21b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Shoot as many targets as you can<C=R> in Mother Base's Shooting Range.\n"
"  Time Limit: 3:00\n"
"  # of Targets: Unlimited"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>在母基地射击场尽可能多地射击目标<C=R>。\n  时间限制：3:00\n  目标数：无限"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa31b1e
msgid "ABOUT SBM028"
msgstr "关于SBM028"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa41b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Rescue the prisoners from the Torture Chamber<C=R> in the Mine Base.\n"
"  Time Limit: 3:00\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery Device<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 3"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>从矿井基地的拷问室救出俘虏<C=R>。\n  时间限制：3:00\n  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收装置<C=R>\n  目标数：3"

