#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb40159
msgid ""
"November 4, 1974, Barranquilla Coast, Colombia\n"
"MSF's \"Soldiers Without Borders\" headquarters.\n"
"  From \"Opening / Investigate the Supply Facility\""
msgstr "1974年11月4日，哥伦比亚巴兰基亚海岸\nMSF“无国界士兵”总部。\n  出自“开场／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb50159
msgid ""
"Snake hears his name called during training at MSF's \"Soldiers Without Borders\" headquarters in Colombia.\n"
"  From \"Opening / Investigate the Supply Facility\""
msgstr "SNAKE在哥伦比亚MSF“无国界士兵”总部训练时听到有人叫他的名字。\n  出自“序幕／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5ac9d
msgid "Delve into the swampy jungles of Eastern Limón and make your way to the Sandinista hideout, where you will make contact with their Comandante."
msgstr "深入利蒙东部的沼泽丛林，前往桑地诺派藏身处，与他们的指挥官取得联系。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5aca1
msgid "Neutralize the enemy attack chopper."
msgstr "制伏敌方攻击直升机。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5aca5
msgid "Stop Peace Walker!"
msgstr "阻止和平行者！"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5aca9
msgid "Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base again. Find him and bring him back. "
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫又从母基地逃走了。找到他并把他带回来。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5b11d
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbab11d
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: Isla del Monstruo\n"
"<C=FF4040>Hunt the Tigrex<C=R>.\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."
msgstr "任务地点：怪物岛\n<C=FF4040>狩猎轰龙<C=R>。\n\n<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb60159
msgid ""
"Galvez introduces himself as a \"professor\" from Costa Rica and presents his request to Snake.\n"
"  From \"Opening / Investigate the Supply Facility\""
msgstr "加尔维斯自称是来自哥斯达黎加的“教授”，向SNAKE提出请求。\n  出自“序幕／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb70159
msgid ""
"Snake infiltrates the inner coastal facility where Paz was imprisoned to investigate the U.S. mercenary base.\n"
"  From \"Opening / Investigate the Supply Facility\""
msgstr "SNAKE潜入帕兹曾被关押的沿岸内部设施，调查美军雇佣兵基地。\n  出自“序幕／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb80159
msgid ""
"In order to gather information about the local area, Snake heads to a boathouse to make contact with the FSLN Comandante.\n"
"  From \"Contact the Sandinista Comandante\""
msgstr "为收集当地情报，SNAKE前往船屋与FSLN指挥官接触。\n  出自“接触桑地诺派指挥官”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb90159
msgid ""
"Snake makes it to the Banana Plantation in pursuit of Amanda.\n"
"  From \"Pursue Amanda\""
msgstr "SNAKE追至香蕉园寻找阿曼达。\n  出自“追踪阿曼达”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xba0159
msgid ""
"After battling with the armored vehicle, Snake notices Amanda's presence up ahead.\n"
"  From \"Armored Vehicle Battle: LAV-Type G\""
msgstr "与装甲车交战后，SNAKE发现阿曼达就在前方。\n  出自“装甲车战：LAV-Type G”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbb0159
msgid ""
"Snake finds Amanda's little brother, Chico, in the Irazú Prison Facility.\n"
"  From \"Resuce Chico\""
msgstr "SNAKE在伊拉苏收容设施找到阿曼达的弟弟奇科。\n  出自“营救奇科”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbb1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend all targets and defeat the enemy force<C=R> in the Mine Base.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing all supplies to be destroyed will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 30 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>守住所有目标并击退敌军<C=R>，地点在矿井基地。\n<C=FF4040>所有补给被摧毁将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n  目标数：30（士兵数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbc0159
msgid ""
"Utilizing the information provided by Chico, Snake makes his way to the railroad transport route.\n"
"  From \"Pursue the Jungle Train\""
msgstr "利用奇科提供的情报，SNAKE前往铁路运输路线。\n  出自“追踪丛林列车”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbc1b1e
msgid "ABOUT SBM031"
msgstr "关于 SBM031"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbc1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbd1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbe1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbf1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc01b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc11b26
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: El Cadalso\n"
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize the enemy armored vehicle<C=R>.\n"
"Destroy the vehicle or neutralize the enemy soldiers to complete the mission."
msgstr "任务地点：绞刑台\n<C=FF4040>制伏敌方装甲车<C=R>。\n摧毁车辆或制伏敌方士兵即可完成任务。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbd0159
msgid ""
"Snake pursues the nuclear warheads transported from the coast and infiltrates the Crater Base.\n"
"  From \"Infiltrate the Crater Base\""
msgstr "SNAKE追踪从海岸运出的核弹头，潜入火山口基地。\n  出自“潜入火山口基地”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbd1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend the bases<C=R> at the Sorting Shed in Bananal Fruta de Oro from enemy assault.\n"
"Bases will be captured by the enemy if enemy soldiers remain in the base for a certain period of time.\n"
"Bases change color when captured.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing all bases to be captured will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 20 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>守住基地<C=R>，击退进攻黄金果香蕉园分拣棚的敌军。\n敌兵在基地内停留一定时间后，基地将被敌方占领。\n基地被占领后颜色会改变。\n<C=FF4040>所有基地被占领将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n  目标数：20（士兵数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbe1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend the bases<C=R> in Aldea Los Despiertos from enemy assault.\n"
"Bases will be captured by the enemy if enemy soldiers remain in the base for a certain period of time.\n"
"Bases change color when captured.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing all bases to be captured will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 20 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>守住基地<C=R>，击退进攻觉醒者村的敌军。\n敌兵在基地内停留一定时间后，基地将被敌方占领。\n基地被占领后颜色会改变。\n<C=FF4040>所有基地被占领将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n  目标数：20（士兵数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbf1b1e
msgid ""
"Defend the items in the Miners' Residence from the attacking enemy mercenaries and eliminate the attackers.  The mission is a failure once 2 items have been retrieved by the enemy.\n"
"  # of Targets: 10 (number of enemies)"
msgstr "守住矿工住处的物资，击退来袭的敌方雇佣兵并将其消灭。敌方夺走2件物资即任务失败。\n  目标数：10（敌人数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc01b1e
msgid "ABOUT SBM035"
msgstr "关于 SBM035"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc11b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend all targets and defeat the enemy force<C=R> at the Cafetal Aroma Encantado Coffee Plantation.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing all supplies to be destroyed will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 20 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>守住所有目标并击退敌军<C=R>，地点在咖啡芳香种植园。\n<C=FF4040>所有补给被摧毁将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n  目标数：20（士兵数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc21b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend the POW<C=R> in the Mine Base from the oncoming enemy assault.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing the POW to die will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"No Fulton Recovery allowed.\n"
"  # of Targets: 30 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>保护战俘<C=R>，击退来袭矿井基地的敌军。\n<C=FF4040>战俘死亡将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n禁止使用富尔顿回收。\n  目标数：30（士兵数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc21b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc31b26
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: El Cadalso\n"
"Neutralize the enemy armored vehicle. \n"
"Destroy the vehicle or neutralize the enemy soldiers to complete the mission.    "
msgstr "任务地点：绞刑台\n制伏敌方装甲车。\n摧毁车辆或制伏敌方士兵即可完成任务。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc31b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Stop the enemy's advance<C=R> in the AI Weapon Hangar while Snake fights Peace Walker.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing even a single enemy to breach your defense will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>MSF SOLDIERS ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 40"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>阻止敌军推进<C=R>，地点在AI兵器机库，同时SNAKE与和平行者战斗。\n<C=FF4040>哪怕只让一名敌人突破防线也将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅 MSF 士兵<C=R>。\n  目标数：40"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc41b1e
msgid "ABOUT SBM039"
msgstr "关于SBM039"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc41b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xdb1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xdc1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xdd1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xde1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xdf1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xe01b26
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: Catarata de la Muerte\n"
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize the enemy chopper<C=R>.\n"
"Destroy the chopper or neutralize the enemy soldiers to complete the mission."
msgstr "任务地点：死亡瀑布\n<C=FF4040>制伏敌方直升机<C=R>。\n摧毁直升机或制伏敌兵即可完成任务。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc7f465
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd1a372
msgid "[121] <<Hunting Quest: Rathalos>>"
msgstr "[121] <<狩猎任务：火龙>>"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc7f5a5
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd6a372
msgid "[122] <<Hunting Quest: Rathalos / Twilight>>"
msgstr "[122] <<狩猎任务：火龙／黄昏>>"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc7fc65
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xf1a372
msgid "[123] <<Hunting Quest: Tigrex>>"
msgstr "[123] <<狩猎任务：轰龙>>"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xc7fda5
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xf6a372
