msgstr "[124] <<狩猎任务：轰龙／黄昏>>"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd40159
msgid ""
"Snake destroys the unmanned Pupa weapon and makes contact with a certain \"Doctor.\"\n"
"  From \"Pupa Battle\""
msgstr "SNAKE摧毁无人兵器蛹，并与某位“博士”取得联系。\n  出自“蛹战”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd50159
msgid ""
"Snake follows the directions from Huey and delves deep into the Cloud Forest in search of the AI Research Lab.\n"
"  From \"Travel to the Cloud Forest\""
msgstr "SNAKE依照休伊的指引深入云雾林，寻找AI研究所。\n  出自“前往云雾林”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd5ac9d
msgid "Track and locate Amanda, the Sandinista leader and obtain intel on the enemy's bases and the route used to transport the nuclear material."
msgstr "追踪并找到桑地诺派首领阿曼达，获取敌方基地及核材料运输路线的相关情报。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd5aca1
msgid ""
"Head North to Dr. Strangelove's lab, disguised as a Mayan Ruin.\n"
"  Item Needed: <C=FF4040>ID Card (H)<C=R>"
msgstr "北上前往伪装成玛雅遗迹的斯特兰奇洛夫博士研究所。\n  所需物品：<C=FF4040>ID卡(H)<C=R>"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd5aca5
msgid "m0230/Pursue Peace Walker"
msgstr "m0230/追踪和平行者"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd5b11d
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xdab11d
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: Isla del Monstruo\n"
"<C=FF4040>Hunt the Gear REX<C=R>.\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."
msgstr "任务地点：怪物岛\n<C=FF4040>狩猎霸王<C=R>。\n\n<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd60159
msgid ""
"Snake is on his way to the Lab through the Cloud Forest when... \n"
"  From \"Travel to the Cloud Forest\""
msgstr "SNAKE正穿过云雾林前往研究所，此时……\n  出自“前往云雾林”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd6fbf9
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xeff3ae
msgid "[01] Soldiers Without Borders"
msgstr "[01] 无国界士兵"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd6fc39
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xf0f3ae
msgid "[02] Paz's Request"
msgstr "[02] 帕兹请求"

