#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xd80159
msgid ""
"On a mission to destroy the nearly complete AI, Snake has obtained an ID card and enters Dr. Strangelove's Lab.\n"
"  From \"Locate the ID Card\""
msgstr "为摧毁即将完成的AI，SNAKE取得ID卡，进入斯特兰奇洛夫博士的研究所。\n  出自“寻找ID卡”"

