msgid ""
"  Mission Location: Crater Base\n"
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize the Pupa Type II<C=R>.\n"
"Destroy the Pupa or shutdown the onboard AI to complete the mission."
msgstr "任务地点：火山口基地\n<C=FF4040>制伏蛹Type II<C=R>。\n摧毁蛹或关闭其搭载的AI即可完成任务。"

