#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xe41b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize all enemy mercenaries<C=R> at the Back Gate of the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua. Non-lethal methods such as knocking enemies unconscious or putting them to sleep are acceptable.\n"
