"  Mission Location: U.S. Missile Base\n"
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize Peace Walker Type II<C=R>.\n"
"Destroy Peace Walker or shutdown the onboard AI to complete the mission."
msgstr "任务地点：美军导弹基地\n<C=FF4040>制伏和平行者II型<C=R>。\n摧毁和平行者或关闭其搭载的AI即可完成任务。"

